|| The "simple example of a CPL job" that closes the supplement for the
|| pre-pilot system, bound in with the Elementary Programming Manual.
|| The job was preceded by the heading CPL, a title (XYZ123/TEST)
|| and ***U, and followed by ***Z. The output routines were spelt in
|| capitals.

WRITE['*nDEMONSTRATION PROGRAM*n']
$( let x = 1
   WRITE[2x, '*tEnd of test*n'] $)
